OL,3,AProtesters scuffle with police as
OL,4,Amigrants brought ashore on south coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey were taken by coach to a
OL,7,Fprocessing centre in Kent. It is the
OL,8,Fsecond known landing of large numbers
OL,9,Fof migrants this far west along the
OL,10,Fsouth coast in recent years.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
