OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABrazil election goes to run-off as
OL,4,Aright-wing Flavio Bolsonaro wins first
OL,5,Around
OL,6,
OL,7,FFlavio Bolsonaro is the son of the
OL,8,Fformer right-wing president Jair
OL,9,FBolsonaro, who is serving a 27-year
OL,10,Fprison sentence for masterminding a
OL,11,Ffailed coup attempt after losing the
OL,12,Flast election.
OL,14,FThe election was close, with President
OL,15,FLula polling slightly ahead during the
OL,16,Fcampaign. With 99% of the votes
OL,17,Fcounted, Bolsonaro had 47.03% to Lula's
OL,18,F45.16% of the vote.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
