OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AEthiopian rebel forces withdraw from
OL,4,ATigray regional capital
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo residents in Mekelle told the BBC
OL,7,Fthat pro-government forces now control
OL,8,Fthe city and TPLF forces have abandoned
OL,9,Fit. One resident also said mobile phone
OL,10,Fservices appear to have resumed in
OL,11,Fparts of the city.
OL,13,FFighting has erupted in recent weeks
OL,14,Fbetween the TPLF and federal government
OL,15,Fforces alongside allied fighters in
OL,16,Fparts of Ethiopia's northern regions of
OL,17,FTigray, Afar and Amhara.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
